"Is this just a Max keymap?": "这只是一套 Max 快捷键映射吗？",
"No. Blender Max goes beyond a keymap: it overhauls the interface and core workflows to bring the look and functionality of 3ds Max into Blender, while retaining Blender’s own tools and capabilities. The workspace, Command Panel, modifier controls, quad menus and editors work on top of Blender’s native modeling, materials, animation and rendering systems.": "不是。Blender Max 不止是快捷键映射：它重塑了界面和核心工作流程，把 3ds Max 的外观和功能带进 Blender，同时保留 Blender 自身的工具和能力。工作区、命令面板、修改器控件、四元菜单和各个编辑器都构建在 Blender 原生的建模、材质、动画和渲染系统之上。",
