"Yes. Blender Max adds a workspace and workflow controls on top of Blender; your installed add-ons remain available. Use <strong>Shift + N</strong> to open the sidebar where many add-ons put their panels.": "可以。Blender Max 是在 Blender 之上添加工作区和工作流程控件，已安装的插件依然可用。按 <strong>Shift + N</strong> 打开侧栏，许多插件的面板都在那里。",
"Can it open my .max files?": "能打开我的 .max 文件吗？",
"No. Blender Max does not add .max file support. It works with Blender’s own scene and data systems.": "不能。Blender Max 不提供 .max 文件支持，它使用 Blender 自身的场景和数据系统。",
